      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF是一个90亿参数的对话式文本生成模型，以GGUF量化格式发布，目标是在保持生成质量的同时降低部署门槛。GGUF格式让模型能在普通CPU或边缘设备上运行，大幅减少显存占用，并兼容llama.cpp等主流推理框架；MIT许可证使其可自由用于商业项目。你可以用它快速搭建本地聊天机器人、离线知识问答或原型验证，只需下载GGUF文件并加载，即可开始提示词实验，体验轻量化部署带来的便利。",
        "en": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF is a 9-billion-parameter conversational language model released in GGUF format, designed to lower deployment barriers while retaining strong text-generation quality. The GGUF quantization reduces memory and compute requirements, enabling it to run on consumer …",
        "es": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF is a 9-billion-parameter conversational language model released in GGUF format, designed to lower deployment barriers while retaining strong text-generation quality. The GGUF quantization reduces memory and compute requirements, enabling it to run on consumer …"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF是一个90亿参数的对话式文本生成模型，以GGUF量化格式发布，目标是在保持生成质量的同时降低部署门槛。GGUF格式让模型能在普通CPU或边缘设备上运行，大幅减少显存占用，并兼容llama.cpp等主流推理框架；MIT许可证使其可自由用于商业项目。你可以用它快速搭建本地聊天机器人、离线知识问答或原型验证，只需下载GGUF文件并加载，即可开始提示词实验，体验轻量化部署带来的便利。",
        "en": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF is a 9-billion-parameter conversational language model released in GGUF format, designed to lower deployment barriers while retaining strong text-generation quality. The GGUF quantization reduces memory and compute requirements, enabling it to run on consumer CPUs and edge devices via llama.cpp or similar runtimes. Its MIT license and endpoint compatibility simplify integration into existing workflows. You can use it to quickly build local chatbots, offline assistants, or prototype novel conversational interfaces by loading the model file and experimenting with your own prompts.",
        "es": "Ornith-1.0-9B-GGUF is a 9-billion-parameter conversational language model released in GGUF format, designed to lower deployment barriers while retaining strong text-generation quality. The GGUF quantization reduces memory and compute requirements, enabling it to run on consumer CPUs and edge devices via llama.cpp or similar runtimes. Its MIT license and endpoint compatibility simplify integration into existing workflows. You can use it to quickly build local chatbots, offline assistants, or prototype novel conversational interfaces by loading the model file and experimenting with your own prompts."
      },
